cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it accompanies."
title: "amr-from-light-curves: machine learning characterisation of space objects from light curves and orbital parameters"
abstract: >-
  Pipeline for estimating the area-to-mass ratio of catalogued space objects
  and classifying object type, by combining public optical light curves from
  MMT-9 and SDLCD with orbital parameters derived from Space-Track two-line
  element histories, validated against ESA DISCOS ground truth.
